<Border xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
        xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
        Tag="FullBleedBriefing" BorderBrush="#92968C" BorderThickness="1" HorizontalAlignment="Stretch">
  <Border.Resources>
    <Style TargetType="{x:Type TextBlock}">
      <Setter Property="FontFamily" Value="/Assets/Resources/ui/fonts/#Special Elite"/>
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#49677F"/>
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="18"/>
      <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="Normal"/>
      <Setter Property="TextWrapping" Value="Wrap"/>
      <Setter Property="LineHeight" Value="24"/>
      <Setter Property="LineStackingStrategy" Value="BlockLineHeight"/>
    </Style>
  </Border.Resources>
  <Border.Background>
    <LinearGradientBrush StartPoint="0,0" EndPoint="1,0.8">
      <GradientStop Color="#DADCD5" Offset="0"/>
      <GradientStop Color="#F0F0E8" Offset="0.32"/>
      <GradientStop Color="#E7E9E2" Offset="0.76"/>
      <GradientStop Color="#D4D8D1" Offset="1"/>
    </LinearGradientBrush>
  </Border.Background>
  <Grid>
    <Canvas IsHitTestVisible="False" ClipToBounds="True">
      <Ellipse Canvas.Left="13" Canvas.Top="39" Width="10" Height="13" Fill="#616456"/>
      <Path Stroke="#9A9F94" StrokeThickness="1" Data="M 18,39 L 14,28 15,14 11,2"/>
      <Ellipse Canvas.Left="13" Canvas.Top="76" Width="10" Height="13" Fill="#616456"/>
      <Path Stroke="#D3D6CA" StrokeThickness="1.5" Data="M 13,83 C 14,89 20,90 24,85"/>
    </Canvas>
    <Border Width="2" Background="#9A9F94" Opacity="0.09" HorizontalAlignment="Center" IsHitTestVisible="False"/>
    <Border Width="1" Background="#FFFFFF" Opacity="0.32" HorizontalAlignment="Center" Margin="4,0,0,0" IsHitTestVisible="False"/>
    <Border Height="1" Background="#9A9F94" Opacity="0.12" VerticalAlignment="Center" IsHitTestVisible="False"/>
    <StackPanel Margin="38,30,28,30">
      <Border BorderBrush="#A24F4E" BorderThickness="1.5" Padding="14,7" Margin="0,0,5,26"
              HorizontalAlignment="Right" Opacity="0.8" RenderTransformOrigin="0.5,0.5">
        <Border.RenderTransform><RotateTransform Angle="-2"/></Border.RenderTransform>
        <Border.OpacityMask>
          <LinearGradientBrush StartPoint="0,0" EndPoint="0.2,1">
            <GradientStop Color="#E0000000" Offset="0"/>
            <GradientStop Color="#B0000000" Offset="0.32"/>
            <GradientStop Color="#F0000000" Offset="0.35"/>
            <GradientStop Color="#B0000000" Offset="0.71"/>
            <GradientStop Color="#E0000000" Offset="1"/>
          </LinearGradientBrush>
        </Border.OpacityMask>
        <StackPanel>
          <TextBlock Text="SECRET" TextAlignment="Center" Foreground="#A24F4E" FontSize="20"/>
          <TextBlock Text="UK EYES A" TextAlignment="Center" Foreground="#A24F4E" FontSize="20"/>
        </StackPanel>
      </Border>
      <TextBlock TextDecorations="Underline" FontSize="20" LineHeight="26" Margin="0,0,0,18">
OPERATION ORDER 2/82
    <LineBreak/>
    OPERATION PARAQUET
      </TextBlock>
      <TextBlock Margin="0,0,0,22">
Copy No. 5 of 25
    <LineBreak/>
    CINCFLEET NORTHWOOD
    <LineBreak/>
    121800Z APR 82
      </TextBlock>
      <Border Height="1" Background="#7F939E" Opacity="0.45" Margin="0,0,0,22"/>
      <TextBlock Margin="0,0,0,20">
Reference: CINCFLEET's AAA/ACA/IGF 072230Z APR 82 (NOTAL)
    <LineBreak/>
   Time Zone Used Throughout the Order: ZULU.
      </TextBlock>
      <TextBlock Margin="0,0,0,20">
<Run Text="1. SITUATION:" TextDecorations="Underline"/> Argentine forces occupy Grytviken on South Georgia. The garrison is assessed at approximately fifty-four marines, equipped with small arms, mortars, and anti-tank weapons. Surface reinforcement and reconnaissance by P-2 or C-130 aircraft remain possible but unlikely. The submarine SANTA FE and transport BAHIA BUEN SUCESO are nearby after bringing reinforcements to the island. Expect severe weather, low cloud, icing and icebergs.
      </TextBlock>
      <TextBlock Margin="0,0,0,20">
<Run Text="2. MISSION:" TextDecorations="Underline"/> To repossess South Georgia as soon as possible.
      </TextBlock>
      <TextBlock Margin="0,0,0,20">
<Run Text="3. EXECUTION:" TextDecorations="Underline"/> Approach from northeast towards Cumberland Bay. Conduct reconnaissance of the area and locate the Argentine ground positions, SANTA FE, and BAHIA BUEN SUCESO. Land 22 SAS from your ships via helicopter. Engage the Argentine shore positions and coastal transport with gunfire. Remove Argentine personnel with minimum loss of life or damage. Initiation codeword is DANDELION.
      </TextBlock>
      <TextBlock Margin="0,0,0,20">
<Run Text="4. SERVICE SUPPORT:" TextDecorations="Underline"/> Task group completed stores, victuals, and ammunition from RFA FORT AUSTIN before the operation. After recapture of islands, fuel and essential stores only will be provided. No immediate shipboard ammunition replenishment is planned. Conserve remaining ordnance.
      </TextBlock>
      <TextBlock Margin="0,0,0,20">
<Run Text="5. COMMAND AND SIGNAL:" TextDecorations="Underline"/> CINCFLEET retains operational control. Task Group commander controls the landing force. Emission policy is at CTG discretion. The code word for this operation is PARAQUET. The code word is RESTRICTED and its meaning is SECRET-EXCLUSIVE. Acknowledge by signal on receipt.
      </TextBlock>
      <TextBlock Margin="0,0,0,20">
<Run>J. D. E. FIELDHOUSE</Run>
    <LineBreak/>
    Admiral, Commander-in-Chief Fleet
      </TextBlock>
      <Border Height="1" Background="#7F939E" Opacity="0.35" Margin="0,4,0,18"/>
      <TextBlock Text="SECRET / UK EYES A" TextAlignment="Center" FontSize="16" Foreground="#617A8C"/>
    </StackPanel>
  </Grid>
</Border>
